- RJ45 link up; board received 192.168.137.232/24 from 192.168.137.1
- firmware generated with a temporary local test CA; this image is not a
  production release image

Build
- command: bash scripts/build.sh --ota-fixtures
- check_fw_images: OK version=0.1.0 A=0x90000000 B=0x90800000
- A/B image size: 1689152 bytes
- SRAM static use: 388624/524288 bytes (74.12%)

Host tests
- command: make -C app/velaguard/host_tests test
- result: PASS
- MQTT fixture cases: strict TLS, wrong credentials, wrong host name,
  denied SUBACK, QoS1, retained request rejection, foreign device rejection,
